{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir Tycoon</strong> puts you in charge of your own 1960s crime empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage illegal rackets and expand your territory across a city ruled by corruption and ambition. Bribe police to keep the heat low, upgrade your businesses, and outsmart rival families as you rise through the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters: invest in profitable operations to grow your income or build influence to control the city\u2019s power structures. Earn respect, balance loyalty within your crew, and make the tough calls that define your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the game of crime, power, and respect \u2014 and become the city\u2019s most feared boss?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041410?t=1762267518","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041410/044cb0bbd964a0f6b0e9f637add0b9a376a3486c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762267518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041410/04b4e76aa3aabe67f93143b8c48e059925c341ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762267518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041410/04b4e76aa3aabe67f93143b8c48e059925c341ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762267518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir Tycoon</strong> puts you in charge of your own 1960s crime empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage illegal rackets and expand your territory across a city ruled by corruption and ambition. Bribe police to keep the heat low, upgrade your businesses, and outsmart rival families as you rise through the underworld.</